{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/b329eb2060f89ed4487f3e918938b666.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/b329eb2060f89ed4487f3e918938b666.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CardBoard seeks to create a genre between tabletop party games and roguelike deckbuilders. Roll your characters unique dice, move around the board and battle whatever awaits you at the end of each round. Gather some friends or play by yourself and see if you've got what it takes to defeat the ruler of each board on the final round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/f826df480247001cc4acf5f06406cdb7.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/f826df480247001cc4acf5f06406cdb7.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/f826df480247001cc4acf5f06406cdb7.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the cards have their own animation that is unique to it's class. Above are just a few of the cards that Johnathan has with animations tried to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/9c8725cb3ae122f150e670eb31ff906e.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/9c8725cb3ae122f150e670eb31ff906e.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span>Everyone can be the character they want, no healer required. Never get locked out of a character because you weren't fast enough. You can preview the starting deck and see which characters your teammates choose before heading out to a board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/bc252363b57b60092db0766f6da5a654.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/bc252363b57b60092db0766f6da5a654.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/bc252363b57b60092db0766f6da5a654.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the rare cases you might want to change your class before clicking that big green Begin button. Remember, just because a character started as a tank, doesn't mean he can't carry pick up some healing cards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/a80cd95716b1c8c69523ddb56d6e3bca.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/a80cd95716b1c8c69523ddb56d6e3bca.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters move around the board based off the dice they roll. Each character has different dice which amount to different movement capabilities. One character might be able to roll a single D20, while another might have to roll two D6's to determine movement. The D20 might allow one to travel the board faster and complete a deck sooner. However, their cards will require more investment and upgrades to reach the same power as someone with slower movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/39692736f559598e114eeefeea0a5d20.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/39692736f559598e114eeefeea0a5d20.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/39692736f559598e114eeefeea0a5d20.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you don't pass a shop, doesn't mean you won't get something good just for landing on it. It's one of the spaces in CardBoard that grants different rewards when you land on them. Although red and blue spaces always give or take gold, the amount they give'll go up the more turns you're on a board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/20c75ab36de52ecaedf0cb771f958f9a.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/20c75ab36de52ecaedf0cb771f958f9a.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/20c75ab36de52ecaedf0cb771f958f9a.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other tiles have rare chances to give special rewards given you've met other criteria around the board... I'll try not to spoil anything but beware the roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/c7c2deb4b3c74d9da4542c1fa98f2618.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/c7c2deb4b3c74d9da4542c1fa98f2618.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span>There are tons of ways to get new cards and items around the board. One of the those ways are Shops. Currently there are two types, a card shop and an item shop. Card shops can only accept cards and gold, while Item shops accept items and gold. You can either decide to buy individual cards/items or select to get packs. Packs are based off the character you picked and could contain any card/item in the game... good or bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/70d03b768408f872d4d64d7917957548.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/70d03b768408f872d4d64d7917957548.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/70d03b768408f872d4d64d7917957548.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with the upcoming demo. Stay tuned to more characters and boards in the future!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085700?t=1760386995","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/51268975821817c9f2ef49e5b7dc400175075f0a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760386995","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/53a55a39bebac5a73f3fd6b67ba84617da476773/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760386995","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/53a55a39bebac5a73f3fd6b67ba84617da476773/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760386995","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/b329eb2060f89ed4487f3e918938b666.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/b329eb2060f89ed4487f3e918938b666.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CardBoard seeks to create a genre between tabletop party games and roguelike deckbuilders. Roll your characters unique dice, move around the board and battle whatever awaits you at the end of each round. Gather some friends or play by yourself and see if you've got what it takes to defeat the ruler of each board on the final round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/f826df480247001cc4acf5f06406cdb7.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/f826df480247001cc4acf5f06406cdb7.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/f826df480247001cc4acf5f06406cdb7.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the cards have their own animation that is unique to it's class. Above are just a few of the cards that Johnathan has with animations tried to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/9c8725cb3ae122f150e670eb31ff906e.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/9c8725cb3ae122f150e670eb31ff906e.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span>Everyone can be the character they want, no healer required. Never get locked out of a character because you weren't fast enough. You can preview the starting deck and see which characters your teammates choose before heading out to a board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/bc252363b57b60092db0766f6da5a654.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/bc252363b57b60092db0766f6da5a654.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/bc252363b57b60092db0766f6da5a654.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the rare cases you might want to change your class before clicking that big green Begin button. Remember, just because a character started as a tank, doesn't mean he can't carry pick up some healing cards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/a80cd95716b1c8c69523ddb56d6e3bca.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/a80cd95716b1c8c69523ddb56d6e3bca.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters move around the board based off the dice they roll. Each character has different dice which amount to different movement capabilities. One character might be able to roll a single D20, while another might have to roll two D6's to determine movement. The D20 might allow one to travel the board faster and complete a deck sooner. However, their cards will require more investment and upgrades to reach the same power as someone with slower movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/39692736f559598e114eeefeea0a5d20.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/39692736f559598e114eeefeea0a5d20.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/39692736f559598e114eeefeea0a5d20.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you don't pass a shop, doesn't mean you won't get something good just for landing on it. It's one of the spaces in CardBoard that grants different rewards when you land on them. Although red and blue spaces always give or take gold, the amount they give'll go up the more turns you're on a board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/20c75ab36de52ecaedf0cb771f958f9a.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/20c75ab36de52ecaedf0cb771f958f9a.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/20c75ab36de52ecaedf0cb771f958f9a.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other tiles have rare chances to give special rewards given you've met other criteria around the board... I'll try not to spoil anything but beware the roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/c7c2deb4b3c74d9da4542c1fa98f2618.avif?t=1760386995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras_big/c7c2deb4b3c74d9da4542c1fa98f2618.webp?t=1760386995 width=1560 height=260 /></span>There are tons of ways to get new cards and items around the board. One of the those ways are Shops. Currently there are two types, a card shop and an item shop. Card shops can only accept cards and gold, while Item shops accept items and gold. You can either decide to buy individual cards/items or select to get packs. Packs are based off the character you picked and could contain any card/item in the game... good or bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/70d03b768408f872d4d64d7917957548.poster.avif?t=1760386995\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/70d03b768408f872d4d64d7917957548.webm?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/extras/70d03b768408f872d4d64d7917957548.mp4?t=1760386995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with the upcoming demo. Stay tuned to more characters and boards in the future!</p>","developers":["Wooden Barrel Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/3a4c9343db6a9802065d861d500d932626e0d1fc/header.jpg?t=1760386995","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22 Or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen or higher, Intel core i-5 8500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060~, AMD Radeong RX580~<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4085700/1426414883/d698e114d82489d145a5ebf9f2ff57576c0d8d75/1759966661/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759968802","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4085700/1426414883/d698e114d82489d145a5ebf9f2ff57576c0d8d75/1759966661/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759968802","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4085700/1426414883/d698e114d82489d145a5ebf9f2ff57576c0d8d75/1759966661/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759968802","id":257214543,"name":"WishlistCardBoard","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214543/707dc3796d5b631c356fd5059273d9fa1636deb2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759968802"}],"name":"CardBoard","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen or higher, Intel core i-5 8500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060~, AMD Radeong RX580~<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Wooden Barrel Games LLC"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/b96be6952f39c6fc95d84d7b2afa5dd2bed4c33f/ss_b96be6952f39c6fc95d84d7b2afa5dd2bed4c33f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386995","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/b96be6952f39c6fc95d84d7b2afa5dd2bed4c33f/ss_b96be6952f39c6fc95d84d7b2afa5dd2bed4c33f.600x338.jpg?t=1760386995"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/6af677b367df820b042c5a4c7b5eaad876119524/ss_6af677b367df820b042c5a4c7b5eaad876119524.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386995","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/6af677b367df820b042c5a4c7b5eaad876119524/ss_6af677b367df820b042c5a4c7b5eaad876119524.600x338.jpg?t=1760386995"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/996824eb4532172a175c02330ab59439cfdc7cae/ss_996824eb4532172a175c02330ab59439cfdc7cae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386995","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/996824eb4532172a175c02330ab59439cfdc7cae/ss_996824eb4532172a175c02330ab59439cfdc7cae.600x338.jpg?t=1760386995"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/65f724aea05b9007bc0ed79ca6792471994166b5/ss_65f724aea05b9007bc0ed79ca6792471994166b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386995","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/65f724aea05b9007bc0ed79ca6792471994166b5/ss_65f724aea05b9007bc0ed79ca6792471994166b5.600x338.jpg?t=1760386995"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/2bc00454758bf0552030b58fba3fbddd696bc1c3/ss_2bc00454758bf0552030b58fba3fbddd696bc1c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760386995","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085700/2bc00454758bf0552030b58fba3fbddd696bc1c3/ss_2bc00454758bf0552030b58fba3fbddd696bc1c3.600x338.jpg?t=1760386995"}],"short_description":"CardBoard blends the chaotic fun of a party game with the deep strategy of a roguelike deckbuilder. Gather companions or brave it alone. Choose from a variety of characters with unique cards and dice, and battle across dynamic themed boards. No healer required\u2014just a little faith in the cards.","steam_appid":4085700,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/woodenbarrelgames.bsky.social"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}